New PKI System dedicated to TLS certificates:
- CP/CPS certSIGN ROOT CA G4 ;
- CP/CPS certSIGN Web CA G4 - covering 3 Issuing CAs dedicated to issue DV, OV and EV certificates;

eIDAS  PKI Infrastructure under certSIGN ROOT CA G2:
- CP/CPS  certSIGN ROOT CA G2 – the certSIGN G2 PKI infrastructure root CA;
- CP/CPS  certSIGN Web CA – CA that issues certificates for web  authentication - this is split in three CP/CPS for DV, OV and QWAC;
- CP/CPS  certSIGN Web CA G2 – CA that issues certificates for web  authentication - this is in one CP/CPS for DV, OV and QWAC;

